# GeyserModelEngine extension 1.0.9 (upstream 69db544, the build cobblemon-link pinned), cobblemon-link changes:
# - compact JSON output (the phone loads ~4x less than pretty-printed);
# - identical animations, animation controllers and geometry are written once and shared between models (shiny,
#   female and pattern variants), so the phone loads ~3x fewer of them;
# - bone-tints off by default: BetterModel's hurt colour doesn't use them, and on they triple render controllers and geometry.
# Built with :geyser:shadowJar (JDK 21); mirrored as GeyserModelEngineExtension-1.0.9-cl.2.jar on the deps-2026-10-22 release.
diff --git a/geyser/src/main/java/re/imc/geysermodelengineextension/managers/resourcepack/ResourcePackManager.java b/geyser/src/main/java/re/imc/geysermodelengineextension/managers/resourcepack/ResourcePackManager.java
